# First words
@scenario office_lesson_01
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk listen]
pip: Someone just walked into the office. How would you greet them?
pip: Change the greeting in this file, save it, and play the opening again.
@label check
pip: Which line makes Pip speak?
> pip: Come on in! -> correct
> @label start_here -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: A speaker ID before a colon makes a dialogue line. A label names a place to jump. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: A speaker ID before a colon makes a dialogue line. A label names a place to jump.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_01]
[flag tutorial_done_01]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_1]
